{
 "family": "xs_rank",
 "tool": "screen (hourly simulator of the engine's exits, scratch script; each configuration recorded in docs/results/p2_trials.jsonl with tool=screen)",
 "window": "TRAIN 2022-01-13 .. 2024-12-31 (data/longhist, 20-symbol extended universe; market context from data/longhist/context.db rows of the TRAIN span only)",
 "simulator": "xs_rank screening simulator (hourly resolution) mirroring the engine's trade management for a daily\ncross-sectional rank alpha. Every evaluated configuration is recorded in the P2 trial ledger\n(tool=\"screen\", family=\"xs_rank\").\n\nDecision: at the 00:00 UTC daily close (the 23:59 bar; ctx.market = the snapshot of that hour close, read from the\nstored market_context rows), a flat symbol goes long / short from its own cross-sectional rank:\n  mode \"mom\": rank >= 1 - q -> long, rank <= q -> short;  mode \"rev\": the opposite.\nEntry skipped while the upcoming funding (the 00:00 settlement, ctx.funding_rate at 23:59) is adverse by more than\nfund_max (the engine's funding-avoidance exit would close it at the next settlement unless 0.3R up).\n\nEngine rules mirrored (heartless/execution/engine.py, exchange/paper.py, learning/backtester.py; same as the ts_trend\nscreen): market entry at the next bar's open (+ half spread 0.25bp + slippage 1.5bp, taker 5bp); stop = close -/+\nsl_atr * daily ATR14 (Wilder, 1d bars of the symbol); R unit = |fill - stop| + fill * (2 taker + 3bp); stops fill at\nthe trigger (gap: open) less slippage; per hour close: time stop at hold_h hours minus one minute (close if r < 0.5 or\nheld 3x; otherwise breakeven + 1.5 daily-ATR chandelier trail on the last closed daily bar), funding-avoidance exit\nbefore a settlement when r < 0.3 and the upcoming rate is adverse by more than 3bp, funding charged every 8h on the\nnotional at the previous close; one position per symbol; the next decision is the first daily close at or after the\nexit; force-close at the window end (2024-12-31 23:59, never reads 2025). Lab warm-up: evaluation starts at\nmax(window start, first candle + lookback_days + 2 days).",
 "gross_ret_avg_bp": "mean directional return per trade between the filled entry and exit prices (after half spread and slippage, before fees and funding), in bp",
 "rounds": {
  "1": "signal map pre-declared before any result: lookback {24, 72, 168} h x hold {24, 72} h x {momentum, reversal}, q = 0.2, stop 2 daily ATRs (24 h) / 3 (72 h), funding filter 3bp",
  "2": "after round 1 (all cells <= 0, momentum > reversal in every pair): 168 h momentum / 72 h hold with one prior-motivated change each (q = 0.1; dispersion above its TRAIN median; 1.5-ATR stop-loss; skip BTC downtrends) and two volume-conditioned 24 h variants"
 },
